Package: devtool-control-center
Version: 0.4.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: qml-module-qtqml, qml-module-qtqml-models2, qml-module-qtqml-workerscript2, qml-module-qtquick2, qml-module-qtquick-window2, qml-module-qtquick-templates2, qml-module-qtquick-controls2, qml-module-qtquick-layouts, qml-module-qtquick-dialogs, libqt5quick5, libqt5widgets5, libqt5network5
Suggests: python3-pip, pipx, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Mike Silva <mike.ceead@gmail.com>
Description: Native Qt 5 control center for devtool
 Run workflows, monitor live segmented progress, review history, and use a compact desktop HUD.
 The devtool CLI is discovered from PATH or common per-user Python installation paths and is configured separately.
